  m_text: "To: [Name Here]\r\nFrom: [Name Here]\r\n\r\n\tAs the reward for your previous
    job, I have left a stash of weapons and supplies in an old warehouse in the east
    of the district. You should find all the gear you need for whatever mission you\u2019re
    going on, not that you would tell me what that was, and a burner. Don\u2019t
    power it up until you\u2019re back under cover. You\u2019ll get your next instructions
    through that line.\r\n\tI expect to have another job for you soon, but I can\u2019t
    tell you much until all the details are in place. I will send word when I am
    ready, so for now, good luck!\r\n"
